1
00:00:00,572 --> 00:00:01,572
(Various:)Hi, Stuart.

2
00:00:01,907 --> 00:00:04,217
(Stuart:)Oh, good, I'm glad you guys
didn't wait for me to start.

3
00:00:04,343 --> 00:00:08,223
Although you said 7:00
and it's 7:00. That's fine.

4
00:00:10,749 --> 00:00:13,249
(Amy(ringing from tablet):)Oh, it's probably Sheldon.

5
00:00:14,219 --> 00:00:15,199
(Amy(ringing from tablet):)Hi, Sheldon.

6
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,270
(Amy(ringing from tablet):)Everybody's here, say hi.

7
00:00:17,423 --> 00:00:18,363
(Penny:)-Hi.
-Hey, buddy.

8
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:19,090
(Penny:)Hey.

9
00:00:19,258 --> 00:00:20,098
(Howard:)-Howdy.
-Hi.

10
00:00:20,259 --> 00:00:21,569
(Stuart:)Hello.

11
00:00:23,929 --> 00:00:24,999
(Sheldon:)The second
I go out of town

12
00:00:25,097 --> 00:00:27,077
(Sheldon:)you throw a Christmas
party without me?

13
00:00:27,433 --> 00:00:28,933
Yeah, kind of.

14
00:00:29,068 --> 00:00:32,278
(Sheldon:)That's so thoughtful.
You guys are the best.

15
00:00:33,706 --> 00:00:35,186
(Penny:)Hey, how's your sister?

16
00:00:35,274 --> 00:00:37,444
(Sheldon:)She went into labor an hour ago.

17
00:00:37,843 --> 00:00:40,183
(Amy:)That's wonderful.
So you're at the hospital?

18
00:00:40,279 --> 00:00:42,949
(Sheldon:)No, she chose to have a home
birth, because she wants

19
00:00:43,082 --> 00:00:46,622
(Sheldon:)to live in the Stone Age
and a cave wasn't available.

20
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,020
(Raj:)You know, many people believe

21
00:00:50,122 --> 00:00:52,032
(Raj:)that home births are better
because the mother

22
00:00:52,124 --> 00:00:53,574
(Raj:)is in a warm, comfortable environment

23
00:00:53,692 --> 00:00:55,642
(Raj:)where she can be
nurtured by loved ones.

24
00:00:55,761 --> 00:00:57,401
(Sheldon:)And turn the bedroom floor

25
00:00:57,529 --> 00:01:02,019
into an amniotic Slip 'n Slide.

